title: "Partitioning {1,...,n} into parts of size at most three whose sums are powers of three: paper, Lean 4 formalization and verification code"
abstract: "We prove the conjecture of Gurvich and Naumova that for every n >= 1 the set {1,...,n} can be partitioned into parts of at most three elements whose sums are powers of 3."
